cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Sr87 adiabatic curves and bound-state pipeline for photoassociation"
message: >-
  If you use this software in scientific work, please cite it using the
  metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Meyroneinc
    given-names: Alban
    alias: halebanc
repository-code: "https://github.com/halebanc/sr87-photoassociation"
abstract: >-
  Computes the adiabatic potential curves of the 87Sr2 dimer (coupled
  hyperfine + fine-structure Hamiltonian) and the vibrational bound-state
  energies of each curve via two independent methods — the mapped Fourier
  grid method (DVR) and Bohr-Sommerfeld (WKB) quantization — together with
  photoassociation linewidths from bound-bound Franck-Condon factors.
keywords:
  - photoassociation
  - ultracold strontium
  - Sr87
  - molecular potentials
  - DVR
  - mapped Fourier grid
  - WKB
  - Franck-Condon factors
license: MIT
year: 2026
